<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Jan 16 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Jan 16 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.083 trillion in the week to January 16 from $750.70 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     54.87		50.60</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     29.24		26.86</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 1028.58	     700.10</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    204.80	     141.88</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	793.65	     538.55</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    289.80	     212.15</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
